VulkanMod 1.8.9 backport
========================

This work is a backport of VulkanMod (https://github.com/xCollateral/VulkanMod),
which is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License 3.0. The original
LICENSE file is retained.

The 1.8.9 implementation also incorporates the Legacy LWJGL3 compatibility layer
by Zarzelcow and the 1.8.9 Vulkan backport by hopccne
(https://github.com/hopccne/VulkanMod-LWJGL3-1.8.9). The upstream backport's
license text is included as LICENSE-HOP. Where that license applies, it is a
non-commercial license; review both licenses before redistributing a combined
build.

No Mojang code is redistributed by this repository. Minecraft 1.8.9 is downloaded
by the build tooling for compilation and must be obtained from Mojang.
